        "kcal": 1100,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Greta looks it. You set your second half in front of Greta. 'Eat,' you say. Greta eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 112,
        "vid": "tom_baker",
        "kcal": 1500,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Tom. 'Tom eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      },
      {
        "day": 119,
        "vid": "katarina_novak",
        "kcal": 1368,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Katarina — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Katarina doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
